/**
 * Figma-exact icons (Skai-Web-App, nodes 2713:4828 / 2713:4864).
 *
 * These paths are copied verbatim from the Figma SVG exports and inlined as
 * React components so the consuming bundle does NOT depend on `<img src=…>`
 * lookups for workspace assets (which fail in production per
 * recurring-issues §128/§129). All icons accept `className` and inherit color
 * via `currentColor` unless a Figma fill mandates a specific brand color.
 *
 * Sizes/viewBoxes match Figma 1:1. Render at 16×16 by default; for 14×14 inner
 * art (the "icons/action" 16×16 wrapper from Figma), wrap with
 * `<span class="size-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center">{icon}</span>`.
 */

